{
  "uid": "orgmemory-runtime",
  "title": "OrgMemory — Runtime",
  "tags": ["orgmemory", "jvm"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(jvm_memory_used_bytes, job)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Why this board and not a community one",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The usual Spring Boot and JVM dashboards are written for a **scrape** pipeline: Prometheus reads `/actuator/prometheus`, and Spring Boot adds `application` and `instance` labels while Micrometer's Prometheus registry emits durations in **seconds**.\n\nThis stack pushes OTLP instead — because `apps/worker` serves no HTTP and cannot be scraped — so series carry `job` and durations arrive in **milliseconds**. Two inherited boards were tried and removed: relabelling can supply `application`, but nothing makes `_seconds_count` exist when the export is `_milliseconds_count`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Heap used",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (job) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=~\"$job\", area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Non-heap used",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (job) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=~\"$job\", area=\"nonheap\"})", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Live threads",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (job) (jvm_threads_live{job=~\"$job\"})", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request latency, p95",
      "description": "Milliseconds, because that is the unit this pipeline exports. A panel written against _seconds_bucket would be empty with no error to say why.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, job) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP requests per second, by status",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{status}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Database connection pool",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (job) (hikaricp_connections_active{job=~\"$job\"})", "legendFormat": "{{job}} active" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (job) (hikaricp_connections_pending{job=~\"$job\"})", "legendFormat": "{{job}} pending" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Garbage collection pause",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "orgmemory-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, job) (rate(jvm_gc_pause_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{job}} p95" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
